Our records show that the following items on your account {CustomerCode} are now overdue. The total overdue is {Currency} {OverdueAmount}.

{InvoiceList}

If you have already paid, thank you and please ignore this letter. Otherwise we would be grateful if you could arrange payment as soon as possible.

Yours sincerely

Credit Control
{CompanyName}
{CompanyPhone} {CompanyEmail}'),(2,'Second reminder',60,'Second reminder - overdue account {CustomerCode}','Dear {CustomerName},

Despite our earlier reminder the following items on your account {CustomerCode} remain unpaid. The total overdue is {Currency} {OverdueAmount}.

{InvoiceList}

Please arrange payment immediately, or contact us today if there is a reason why these items have not been paid.

Yours sincerely

Credit Control
{CompanyName}
{CompanyPhone} {CompanyEmail}'),(3,'Final notice',90,'FINAL NOTICE - account {CustomerCode}','Dear {CustomerName},

FINAL NOTICE

The following items on your account {CustomerCode} are seriously overdue. The total overdue is {Currency} {OverdueAmount}.

{InvoiceList}

Unless payment is received within 7 days your account will be put on stop and no further goods will be supplied. Interest and late payment fees will be charged on overdue balances in accordance with our terms and conditions.

Yours sincerely

Credit Control
{CompanyName}
{CompanyPhone} {CompanyEmail}');

